      "type": "game",
      "name": "SherloCAT Holmes Nonogram",
      "steam_appid": 2728040,
      "required_age": 0,
      "is_free": false,
      "controller_support": "full",
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f30a053f7ece2c254051d3e8fa5a275a.poster.avif?t=1765469636\" width=660 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f30a053f7ece2c254051d3e8fa5a275a.webm?t=1765469636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SherloCat Holmes Nonogram is a nonogram (picross) game that challenges your logic, focus, and deduction skills through numerical grids and hidden images.<br>Nonogram — also known as picross or hanjie — is a classic puzzle in which you use numerical clues to correctly fill in the squares of a grid and reveal an image at the end of each stage.<br>The game was designed both for beginners and experienced players, offering a smooth progression of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose how to solve your puzzles</strong><br>The game features two modes:<br>• Classic Mode – a cozy experience<br>Solve nonograms at your own pace, with no time limits or penalties. Perfect for a relaxing, focused experience.<br>• Challenge Mode – a hard experience<br>A mode for those who want to push their limits: with a timer and error limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/8ae2023b03d5c81404f31d93d2efa524.poster.avif?t=1765469636\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/8ae2023b03d5c81404f31d93d2efa524.webm?t=1765469636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A different kind of puzzle:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sherlock Holmes was on vacation in Brazil. Everything seemed peaceful, just as a vacation should be… until he disappeared without leaving any clues.<br>To uncover his whereabouts, you’ll need to help SherloCat by solving the nonograms.<br>Complete nonograms of different sizes and difficulty levels to progress through the game and unlock clues.<br>Every 10 completed nonograms reveal a new clue. By finishing all sets, you gather all the information needed to solve the mystery of Sherlock Holmes’ disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/c582c5020d584900e6e3799b6987be52.webp?t=1765469636\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/c582c5020d584900e6e3799b6987be52.poster.avif?t=1765469636\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=201 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Two game modes so you can choose how to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Difficulty progression designed for learning and mastery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Mix of mechanics: classic Picross + a short investigation story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stage sizes from 10x10 to 25x25 — 120 levels with varying difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Relaxing music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hint system to help with puzzle solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Beautiful, cozy visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Clean and easy-to-understand interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f946ee401f6a0256707d5125d3c4a78b.poster.avif?t=1765469636\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f946ee401f6a0256707d5125d3c4a78b.webm?t=1765469636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f946ee401f6a0256707d5125d3c4a78b.mp4?t=1765469636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose your favorite mode, complete all 120 nonograms, and enjoy a unique puzzle experience.</p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f30a053f7ece2c254051d3e8fa5a275a.poster.avif?t=1765469636\" width=660 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f30a053f7ece2c254051d3e8fa5a275a.webm?t=1765469636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SherloCat Holmes Nonogram is a nonogram (picross) game that challenges your logic, focus, and deduction skills through numerical grids and hidden images.<br>Nonogram — also known as picross or hanjie — is a classic puzzle in which you use numerical clues to correctly fill in the squares of a grid and reveal an image at the end of each stage.<br>The game was designed both for beginners and experienced players, offering a smooth progression of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose how to solve your puzzles</strong><br>The game features two modes:<br>• Classic Mode – a cozy experience<br>Solve nonograms at your own pace, with no time limits or penalties. Perfect for a relaxing, focused experience.<br>• Challenge Mode – a hard experience<br>A mode for those who want to push their limits: with a timer and error limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/8ae2023b03d5c81404f31d93d2efa524.poster.avif?t=1765469636\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/8ae2023b03d5c81404f31d93d2efa524.webm?t=1765469636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A different kind of puzzle:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sherlock Holmes was on vacation in Brazil. Everything seemed peaceful, just as a vacation should be… until he disappeared without leaving any clues.<br>To uncover his whereabouts, you’ll need to help SherloCat by solving the nonograms.<br>Complete nonograms of different sizes and difficulty levels to progress through the game and unlock clues.<br>Every 10 completed nonograms reveal a new clue. By finishing all sets, you gather all the information needed to solve the mystery of Sherlock Holmes’ disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/c582c5020d584900e6e3799b6987be52.webp?t=1765469636\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/c582c5020d584900e6e3799b6987be52.poster.avif?t=1765469636\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=201 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Two game modes so you can choose how to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Difficulty progression designed for learning and mastery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Mix of mechanics: classic Picross + a short investigation story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stage sizes from 10x10 to 25x25 — 120 levels with varying difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Relaxing music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hint system to help with puzzle solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Beautiful, cozy visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Clean and easy-to-understand interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f946ee401f6a0256707d5125d3c4a78b.poster.avif?t=1765469636\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f946ee401f6a0256707d5125d3c4a78b.webm?t=1765469636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f946ee401f6a0256707d5125d3c4a78b.mp4?t=1765469636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose your favorite mode, complete all 120 nonograms, and enjoy a unique puzzle experience.</p>",
